-sname freewhen
-setcookie freewhen_local

## Rooms are RAM-only and short-lived; a crash dump would be the one artifact
## that outlives them. Zero retention means zero crash dumps.
-env ERL_CRASH_DUMP /dev/null
-env ERL_CRASH_DUMP_SECONDS 0

+K true
+A 8
## Bound the atom table: room hashes and aliases must never become atoms.
+t 1048576
